hi， Hello everyone, I am the developer of the Family Rise Simulator:
Based on the suggestions of many players, I made significant modifications to the system in the front-end time. Now, the 'family flavor' in the game has become stronger, and the strategic aspect has not weakened;
The new version has been released as a demo. We welcome everyone to continue criticizing and correcting it. If you have any improvement suggestions, please feel free to leave a message. Thank you!
